{"component_id_namespace":"ec077a53-0b40-5f21-b1fe-a62094d2476b","component_schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","components":[{"attributes":{"code":"TMC","legacy_node_id":"ks-topeka:tmc:3.45.050","page_type":"section"},"citation":"3.45.050","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/3.45.050","content_hash":"1686da12522035d413bb13467def3af50f3442b7d208be66381be17b73f00177","heading":"Contents of notice.","ordinal":0,"parent_source_component_key":null,"schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:3.45.050:section","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/3.45.050","text":"Any notice prepared for mailing under this chapter shall contain the following information and be in the following form:\nNOTICE OF PUBLIC HEARING\nYou are hereby notified that a public hearing will be held on ________, 20_____ at ________ (time) ________m. in the Commission Chambers, Second Floor of the Municipal Building, 214 East Eighth Street, Topeka, Kansas, to consider the advisability of the following public improvement:\n(Here give general nature of improvement including location)\nThe estimated or probable cost is $________; such cost to be paid ________ percent by the City of Topeka and ________ percent by the improvement district.\n(Here give legal description of proposed improvement district)\nThe proposed method of assessment is: _________________________________\n_________________________________\nOral or written comments on this proposed public improvement are invited by the Council and will be given every consideration.\nIf you lease or rent this property, please forward this notice to the landowner.\n__________________ City Clerk\n(Code 1981 § 35-21. Code 1995 § 126-39.)\nCross References: City Clerk, TMC 2.20.010 .","type":"section","workbench_component_id":"41eb7b4d-98b4-51b1-9cfa-8b41f466d4ef"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"3.45.050","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/3.4